{"parentUuid":"74848ba9-e31e-4b6c-930d-e9d8dc2e2cb5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvpYJMwnihgUBUoC6G1G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_read_input_tokens":236613,"output_tokens":1277,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":408},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":512,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1277,"cache_read_input_tokens":236613,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":512},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10948,"serverClassifierRequest":"2c51574f-7423-491a-a01c-328291884b2f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvpYHRtUHojRLW5U5MbZ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"86697ca7-08da-4579-9783-2a9b7fc5d242","timestamp":"2026-10-11T17:10:31.998Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"86697ca7-08da-4579-9783-2a9b7fc5d242","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvpYJMwnihgUBUoC6G1G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Waiting for round 2 to report before the next deploy, so the tester sees a stable site.\n\nHere's where things stand:\n\n- **Gemini cloud tier: live and verified.** DigitalOcean still refuses (402, account blocked), so Google AI Studio's Gemma 4 answers. With the hub off on live, the photo draft took 2.9 s and the Plan draft 1.4 s.\n  - The fix that made it work: Gemma 4 on Google's API \"thinks\" first by default and took 21.7 s with no answer. Setting thinking to its lowest level cut that to 1.4 s.\n  - There's also one quick retry, because that setting sometimes returns a fast server error.\n  - The design is recorded in ADR-0026.\n- **One thing for you to decide:** Google's free-tier terms say it may use what it receives to improve its products, and staff may read it.\n  - Plan drafts send only the ask line. Photos go only when the host taps, and the app, /ai/ and the privacy page now say \"Google may review it\".\n  - Turning on billing for the Google project would move it to paid terms. I haven't touched that; the manager has queued it for you.\n- **Fresh-eyes fixes, round 1: live (86d5b65).** The first tester scored 5/10. The demo test passes against the live site.\n  - The demo now shows a count instead of who said yes.\n  - You play the host, then one turn as a friend.\n  - It has a meetup moment and a real ending.\n  - I also fixed the start screen contrast, added a paste box for \"Got a link?\", and put nav links on phones.\n- **One fix I couldn't confirm:** the bug where onboarding showed through the Send screen didn't reproduce on the normal path. I made onboarding close once you pass the camera, and the app now reloads when you come back to it through the browser's back button. Round 2 will show whether that's enough.\n- **Committed, not deployed yet:**\n  - The /how/ page is now a step-by-step tour using the six real demo screens. Lighthouse scores 100 on all five site pages, mobile and desktop.\n  - A darker backing behind the \"Sent a moment ago\" status line.\n  - These go out in the next deploy, after round 2.\n- **Next:** round 2 is a new tester with no context, testing the live site. The manager's target is 8/10 or better. I'll fix what it reports, then start ElevenLabs.\n- **Two small items still open:** the compass shows a flame instead of an arrow, and two menu items share an icon.\n- **Waiting on you:** the run page still says the repo link \"goes live when the repo is public\". That's true, and making the repo public needs your yes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_read_input_tokens":236613,"output_tokens":1277,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":408},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":512,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1277,"cache_read_input_tokens":236613,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":512},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2c51574f-7423-491a-a01c-328291884b2f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfvpYHRtUHojRLW5U5MbZ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b3bb28ff-900e-4295-93bb-47a102a8c438","timestamp":"2026-10-11T17:10:33.440Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
