s, the home headline sat below the fold. The words and \"Try a demo\" now come first.\n- Fields showed a box inside a box on photos. Now there's one box.\n- Copy: \"Writing a short invite…\", \"Use my words\", \"Bench at the spot\".\n\nQuality checks:\n- Lighthouse is 100 on all five pages, mobile and desktop. /how/ dipped to 99, and smaller 240 px phone images fixed it.\n- The JS budget went over at 151.2 KB because the deck gained strings. Onboarding and the Plan screens now load on demand, which brings /app to 149 KB. I checked the Plan screen by hand, since no e2e covers it.\n- Every e2e passes, and the unit tests pass 668/58/26.\n\nI'll report round 3's score when it comes in. ElevenLabs starts once we reach 8/10."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"1e8cecc6-745c-40d4-b5a9-d0073c2a5171","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvsHugPcNVf58KmMia6q","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"965faef4-0044-4891-acf6-28aab2f459a4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T17:46:33.285Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
