{"parentUuid":"0fb29bf5-a16d-4a5b-87d8-56107a89ffda","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvsJbtLveuy39HmB7kWg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fresh-eyes round 2 scored 6/10, up from 5. Everything it raised is fixed and live as 0842d28, and round 3 is now testing the live site with a new tester that has no context.\n\n**What round 2 found, and what I changed:**\n- **Two place fields on Send that disagreed:** there's now one. The \"Where you'll be\" row only shows when the map has already named the spot.\n- **The demo dropped the place you typed:** it now keeps it.\n- **Names nobody explained:**\n  - The demo now opens with \"A sample invite from you, {name}. Tap Send it.\"\n  - The switch button is \"Friend's view\", and its banner says \"Now you're Amor, a friend of {name}.\"\n- **A condition was saved without telling you:** it now shows \"You're in if: back by 5 PM\".\n- **Numbers that didn't match:** the bench is 40 m, the walk is 2 min, and the compass says 150 m. The \"here\" count and the faces now follow the real count.\n- **The headline sat below the fold on phones:** the words and \"Try a demo\" now come first, with the screenshot under them.\n- **Text boxes showed a box inside a box on photos:** now there's one box.\n- **/how/:** on phones each step is a row, with a small screenshot beside its line.\n\n**Checks:**\n- **Lighthouse:** 100 on all five pages, mobile and desktop. /how/ dipped to 99 until I gave phones smaller images.\n- **App JS budget (150 KB):** /app went over at 151.2 KB once the new copy was added. Onboarding and the Plan screens now load only when needed, which brings it to 149 KB.\n- **Plan screen:** no automated test covers it, so I opened it by hand. It works.\n- **Tests:** every e2e suite passes, and the unit tests pass. On the live site, the demo e2e and the smoke check both pass.\n\nThe manager's bar is 8/10 before ElevenLabs starts. I'll fix whatever round 3 finds and report its score when it's in. The Google billing question and making the repo public are still yours to decide."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":293503,"output_tokens":684,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":684,"cache_read_input_tokens":293503,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3f16112f-1218-451b-91c2-e7c4f8205090","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvsJaxnLYBHgfBiUqDos","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"94cfed9e-1812-4d94-b4b1-556ec2ba8cdb","timestamp":"2026-10-11T17:46:41.696Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
