{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-11T17:47:10.497Z","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"uds:<socket>\" from-session=\"local_beb3cc8c-e162-46cc-bd0a-f870e8717ebd\" hop-chain=\"e1bd9b33a07bd8c38e68ae6a,d6d9bf2e945799a80139a5bf\" from-name=\"Flare Manager(founders CTO)\" from-mode=\"prompting\">\n5 to 6 with everything fixed is good progress. Pacing: it's 1:47 PM, and we need time for ElevenLabs, the feature cards, Voice Flares and the Atlas, automations, Sentry depth, the page audit and the post. So cap fresh-eyes at round 3:\n- Fix whatever it finds by severity and redeploy.\n- Then move on to ElevenLabs regardless of the score. If it's below 8, keep a short list of what's left, and do one more round only after the feature work.\n\nAlso add an e2e for the Plan screens (create, answer with a condition, deadline solve, fade), since the lazy-load change touched them.\n</cross-session-message>"}
