son (BR-P-5)\", again.body.code === \"fade_used\", again.body.code);\n170:    check(\"plan: Gone after S + step + 60 min\", gone.status === 410, `${gone.status}`);\n173:  // 1b. A Plan where the condition decides the step, then a fade moves it (BR-S-1, BR-P-6).\n183:        kind: \"plan\",\n188:        plan: {\n208:      \"plan 1b: the condition picks step 2, the biggest step all three can do\",\n209:      lit.plan?.current_step === 2,","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a9d140c2-4644-4977-b243-f9cef34d831c","timestamp":"2026-10-11T17:47:25.493Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"apps/server/src/main.ts:29:// End-to-end test clock (scripts/e2e-field.ts): only with FLARE_E2E_CLOCK=1 AND an in-memory\napps/server/src/main.ts:30:// database, so it can never be switched on against real data. POST /__e2e/clock {advance_ms}.\napps/server/src/main.ts:32:let clockOffset = 0;\napps/server/src/main.ts:34:  app.post(\"/__e2e/clock\", async (c) => {\napps/server/src/main.ts:36:    clockOffset += Math.max(0, Number(b.advance_ms ?? 0));\napps/server/src/main.ts:37:    return c.json({ now: new Date(Date.now() + clockOffset).toISOString() });\napps/server/src/main.ts:42:  ...(e2eClock ? { clock: { now: () => new Date(Date.now() + clockOffset) } } : {}),\nscripts/e2e-field.ts\napps/web/test/e2e/demo.ts\n105:  // 1. A Plan, \"Fairlane walk at 11?\", with a deadline, conditions and a fade (E15-S1 to S4).\n115:        kind: \"plan\",\n120:        plan: {\n133:      \"plan: created with 4 steps\",\n134:      created.status === 201 && created.body.plan?.steps?.length === 4,\n147:    check(\"plan: conditions saved as rules only\", rb.status === 200 && rb.body.rules?.[0]?.type === \"max_step\");\n149:    check(\"plan: stays Kindling until the deadline (BR-P-2)\", before.state === \"kindling\", before.state);\n154:      \"plan: lights at the deadline at the step with the most people\",\n155:      lit.state === \"lit\" && lit.plan?.current_step === 4,\n156:      `${lit.state} step ${lit.plan?.current_step