{"parentUuid":"5d559d16-c8b5-4f61-8567-4e5ac526efd5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvuG12YQcDsDZUUznYkf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01218H9Ghizm6FEDkNXdcYK8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && rm -f docs/frontend/evidence/e2e-say-fail.png && git add \"apps/web/src/routes/(site)/site.css\" apps/web/src/routes/app/demo/+page.svelte apps/web/src/lib/components/Sheet.svelte apps/web/src/lib/screens/P1PlanAsk.svelte apps/web/test/e2e/demo.ts && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFresh-eyes round 3 fixes: the site's CSS no longer reaches the app\n\nRound 3 (5/10) found the photo under a navy block on Send and the\nonboarding photo squashed to 230 px, on phones. Cause: site.css was\nglobal, and SvelteKit keeps it after a client-side jump from the\nwebsite into /app/, so the site's .hero and .art rules hit the app's\nown .hero and .art. Every site.css rule is now scoped under .site.\n\nAlso:\n- Demo: the condition goes through the real parser (nonsense gets\n  \"I didn't catch that\"; the banner shows the read-back); \"Back to\n  you, {name}. One more yes: 2 in.\" after the friend's view; the yes\n  that lights the smaller plan shows before \"It's lit\".\n- Sheets: a visible close button, and a tall sheet (the menu) stops\n  72 px short of the top so there is backdrop to tap.\n- Plan for later: the two date-time fields stack on phones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit add apps/server apps/web/src apps/web/static/voice apps/web/test docs scripts/gen-voice.ts scripts/deploy-render.ts design/prototype/src/lib/copy/deck.json NOTICE package.json && git reset -q apps/web/static/scenic apps/web/static/scenery 2>/dev/null; git status --short | grep -v \"^??\" | head -40","description":"Commit round-3 fixes; stage ElevenLabs work"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":688,"cache_read_input_tokens":422017,"output_tokens":760,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":688,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":760,"cache_read_input_tokens":422017,"cache_creation_input_tokens":688,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":688},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01218H9Ghizm6FEDkNXdcYK8":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && rm -f docs/frontend/evidence/e2e-say-fail.png && git add \"apps/web/src/routes/(site)/site.css\" apps/web/src/routes/app/demo/+page.svelte apps/web/src/lib/components/Sheet.svelte apps/web/src/lib/screens/P1PlanAsk.svelte apps/web/test/e2e/demo.ts && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFresh-eyes round 3 fixes: the site's CSS no longer reaches the app\n\nRound 3 (5/10) found the photo under a navy block on Send and the\nonboarding photo squashed to 230 px, on phones. Cause: site.css was\nglobal, and SvelteKit keeps it after a client-side jump from the\nwebsite into /app/, so the site's .hero and .art rules hit the app's\nown .hero and .art. Every site.css rule is now scoped under .site.\n\nAlso:\n- Demo: the condition goes through the real parser (nonsense gets\n  \"I didn't catch that\"; the banner shows the read-back); \"Back to\n  you, {name}. One more yes: 2 in.\" after the friend's view; the yes\n  that lights the smaller plan shows before \"It's lit\".\n- Sheets: a visible close button, and a tall sheet (the menu) stops\n  72 px short of the top so there is backdrop to tap.\n- Plan for later: the two date-time fields stack on phones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit add apps/server apps/web/src apps/web/static/voice apps/web/test docs scripts/gen-voice.ts scripts/deploy-render.ts design/prototype/src/lib/copy/deck.json NOTICE package.json && git reset -q apps/web/static/scenic apps/web/static/scenery 2>/dev/null; git status --short | grep -v \"^??\" | head -40","description":"Commit round-3 fixes; stage ElevenLabs work"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"97a37187-6087-4cb9-9a85-da5adb12164c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvuFyhQo21W8g2xjt3vM","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b0626d9-d642-42dd-97b5-a9e576412c1a","timestamp":"2026-10-11T18:12:20.538Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
