{"parentUuid":"f2220466-a39f-4ec6-a0ea-d43b28c6583b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>11676690 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"08232e51-7888-4702-a4a3-0d82196ce90d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T18:12:24.780Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>11676690 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"08232e51-7888-4702-a4a3-0d82196ce90d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvuGv2SYEQqtobj3gQyH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TRjHPLVuRixf1uM96VCRaA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nElevenLabs: a warm compass voice that sends nothing, and Voice Spark\n\nADR-0027. Output voice for Flare's own lines, plus an opt-in way to\nsay your own Spark. No conversation recording, ever.\n\n- Warm voice: 54 fixed compass lines (distances, directions, close,\n  hold flat, no GPS) recorded once by scripts/gen-voice.ts (premade\n  voice Sarah, eleven_multilingual_v2): 698 characters of the free\n  10,000, 684 KB of MP3. No names, no places, nothing anyone typed.\n  Opt-in under My needs with Hear it; turning it on saves the clips on\n  the phone for use with no signal; the phone's own voice is the\n  fallback. The player loads only where it is on (JS budget).\n- Voice Spark: Say it on the Spark screen when /config says\n  voice.spark. Tap, up to 10 s of your own voice, POST\n  /api/v1/voice/spark -> Scribe (scribe_v2) -> words to edit. Audio\n  types only, 400 KB, zero-filled, not stored or logged, daily cap.\n  Scribe read our clips back word for word in 420-492 ms.\n- Privacy page line, NOTICE credit, openapi + contract test, server\n  tests (off without key, 415, 413, null on failure, cap), web unit\n  test (clip mapping; every clip shipped), sparks e2e (real\n  MediaRecorder from a synthetic mic, words land in the field).\n- deploy-render sends ELEVENLABS_API_KEY; media-src allows blob:;\n  .mp3 served as audio/mpeg.\n- Link page JS: the Plan screens P4-P7 and Say it load on demand;\n  /g/ 149 KB, /app 149.5 KB (budget 150).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep -E \"deploy started|ELEVEN|env vars\"","description":"Commit ElevenLabs; push; deploy","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1592,"cache_read_input_tokens":422705,"output_tokens":862,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1592,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":862,"cache_read_input_tokens":422705,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1592,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1592},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01TRjHPLVuRixf1uM96VCRaA":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nElevenLabs: a warm compass voice that sends nothing, and Voice Spark\n\nADR-0027. Output voice for Flare's own lines, plus an opt-in way to\nsay your own Spark. No conversation recording, ever.\n\n- Warm voice: 54 fixed compass lines (distances, directions, close,\n  hold flat, no GPS) recorded once by scripts/gen-voice.ts (premade\n  voice Sarah, eleven_multilingual_v2): 698 characters of the free\n  10,000, 684 KB of MP3. No names, no places, nothing anyone typed.\n  Opt-in under My needs with Hear it; turning it on saves the clips on\n  the phone for use with no signal; the phone's own voice is the\n  fallback. The player loads only where it is on (JS budget).\n- Voice Spark: Say it on the Spark screen when /config says\n  voice.spark. Tap, up to 10 s of your own voice, POST\n  /api/v1/voice/spark -> Scribe (scribe_v2) -> words to edit. Audio\n  types only, 400 KB, zero-filled, not stored or logged, daily cap.\n  Scribe read our clips back word for word in 420-492 ms.\n- Privacy page line, NOTICE credit, openapi + contract test, server\n  tests (off without key, 415, 413, null on failure, cap), web unit\n  test (clip mapping; every clip shipped), sparks e2e (real\n  MediaRecorder from a synthetic mic, words land in the field).\n- deploy-render sends ELEVENLABS_API_KEY; media-src allows blob:;\n  .mp3 served as audio/mpeg.\n- Link page JS: the Plan screens P4-P7 and Say it load on demand;\n  /g/ 149 KB, /app 149.5 KB (budget 150).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep -E \"deploy started|ELEVEN|env vars\"","description":"Commit ElevenLabs; push; deploy","timeout":900000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d689a101-8345-4c77-be29-721a0712de0e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfvuGtYP1W8brW3kPexGt","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"22b806a2-def5-4433-bc41-51d329c558be","timestamp":"2026-10-11T18:12:33.859Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
