{"parentUuid":"5c3a8f65-5075-4edc-9cbb-e974e256a3cb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvv8BMHyWY8nAd4hFyyh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01553UUHWnweootgtpsqQymU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && npx biome check --write \"apps/web/src/routes/(site)\" apps/web/test >/dev/null 2>&1; npm run lint 2>&1 | grep -c \"×\"; node scripts/lighthouse.ts --min 100 --out <tmp>/904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa/scratchpad/lh 2>&1 | tail -1; npm test 2>&1 | grep \"Tests \"; git add \"apps/web/src/routes/(site)\" apps/web/static/site/feat apps/web/src/routes/app/demo/+page.svelte apps/web/test/e2e/demo.ts design/prototype/src/lib/copy/deck.json docs/content docs/design/redesign/after/demo-*.jpg && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nWebsite: feature cards and a Built with strip (backlog #14)\n\n- Ten cards, one per feature that exists today (private yes, shrink\n  to an Ember, the friend's one-tap join, Plans, the talking compass,\n  bench-to-bench loops, the crew space, Sparks, Telegram and\n  iMessage, deletion), each with a 240x360 WebP of the real screen\n  (4-10 KB, lazy) and a line; one Try a demo at the end. Features\n  still being built (Voice Flares, the Atlas, automations) get none.\n- Built with: Gemma 4, Google AI Studio, DigitalOcean (paused for\n  now), ElevenLabs, Sentry, Mastra, OpenStreetMap, Render, SvelteKit,\n  each with what it does in Flare. Plain links, nothing fetched.\n- Demo: Benny's yes comes 0.7 s after Skip and goes straight to lit,\n  so the shrink never shows \"0 more to light it\".\nLighthouse 100 on all five pages, mobile and desktop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"","description":"Check, commit, push, deploy cards","timeout":1500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":