{"parentUuid":"5c562c96-0f68-4314-87c9-d49a576e4ebc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e567af3c-70c1-46ba-b5a8-ec342a0e3f0d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017eWusWK3JMAkTPVohvHZyj","type":"tool_result","content":"    messages:\n      hello: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/hello\" }\n      photoJob: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/photoJob\" }\n      photoBytes: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/photoBytes\" }\n      ladderJob: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/ladderJob\" }\n      tagsJob: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/tagsJob\" }\n      result: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/result\" }\n      ping: { $ref: \"#/components/messages/ping\" }\n    messages:\n      - $ref: \"#/channels/hub/messages/ladderJob\"\n  serverSendsTagsJob:\n    action: receive\n    channel: { $ref: \"#/channels/hub\" }\n    summary: \"ICR-ML5: server sends a Fix the map photo for OSM tags (header, then the photo frame; 8 s)\"\n    messages:\n      - $ref: \"#/channels/hub/messages/tagsJob\"\n      - $ref: \"#/channels/hub/messages/photoBytes\"\n  hubSendsResult:\n    security:\n      - $ref: \"#/components/securitySchemes/hubSecret\"\n    action: send\n            properties:\n              rain_likely: { type: boolean }\n              temp_f: { type: integer }\n\n    tagsJob:\n      name: job\n      title: Tags job header (ICR-ML5)\n      contentType: application/json\n      description: Like photoJob; the next binary frame is the photo. The hub uses prompt osm-tags v1 and enforceOsmTags().\n      payload:\n        type: object\n        additionalProperties: false\n        required: [type, id, kind, bytes, mime]\n        properties:\n          type: { const: job }\n          id: { type: string, format: uuid }\n          kind: { const: tags-draft }\n          bytes: { type: integer, minimum: 1, maximum: 2000000 }\n          mime: { const: image/jpeg }\n\n    result:\n      name: result\n      contentType: application/json\n      payload:\n770:  /api/v1/drafts:\n771-    post:\n772-      tags: [ai]\n773-      operationId: draftFromPhoto\n774-      summary: Six words and a scene from a photo, on our laptop (ADR-0006, ADR-0011)\n775-      description: |\n776-        The phone sends a 768 px JPEG (quality 0.7). The server relays it to the hub in memory,\n777-        zero-fills the buffer after the job, and stores nothing. If the hub is absent, slow\n778-        (6 s) or its answer fails `enforce()`, the response is the template (`tier: rules`)\n779-        and the phone shows the typed fallback (BR-AI-1). Increments `tier_ran.photo.{tier}`.\n780-      parameters:\n781-        - name: cloud\n782-          in: query\n783-          required: false\n784-          description: \"1 = the host opted in to DigitalOcean for this Flare's photo; used only when the hub is absent (ADR-0022)\"\n785-          schema: { type: string, enum: [\"1\"] }\n786-      requestBody:\n787-        required: true\n788-        content:\n789-          image/jpeg:\n790-            schema: { type: string, contentMediaType: image/jpeg, maxLength: 1500000 }\n791-      responses:\n792-        \"200\":\n793-          description: Draft\n794-          content:\n795-            application/json:\n796-              schema: { $ref: \"#/components/schemas/DraftResponse\" }\n797-        \"400\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/BadRequest\" }\n798-        \"413\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/TooLarge\" }\n799-        \"415\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/UnsupportedMedia\" }\n800-        \"429\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/TooMany\" }\n801-\n802-  /api/v1/drafts/ladder:\n803-    post:\n804-      tags: [ai]\n805-      operationId: draftLadder\n806-      summary: Four step labels and minutes from a Plan's ask line (SRS-PLAN-2)\n807-      description: |\n808-        Hub tier with an 8 s budget, else the template ladder. The ask line is at most 80\n809-        characters and carries no place; the phone attaches places from its map pack.\n810-        Ke