0028)\n      contentType: application/octet-stream\n      description: One binary frame, exactly `bytes` long, starting with RIFF....WAVE.\n      payload: { type: string, format: binary }\n\n    result:\n      name: result'''),\n('''            enum: [model_unavailable, unusable_answer, timeout, bad_image]''','''            enum: [model_unavailable, unusable_answer, timeout, bad_image, bad_audio]'''),\n])\nedit('docs/architecture/contracts/openapi.yaml',[('''  /api/v1/drafts/ladder:\n    post:''','''  /api/v1/drafts/voice:\n    post:\n      tags: [ai]\n      operationId: draftFromVoice\n      summary: Voice Flare, the invite and the place line from what the host says, on our laptop (ADR-0028)\n      description: |\n        Up to 10 s of the host saying where they are and what they want to do, as 16 kHz mono\n        WAV. The server relays it to the hub in memory (8 s budget), where Gemma 4 listens and\n        writes the same `{invite, alt}` a photo gets; `enforce()` runs again here. No cloud\n        tier. The buffer is zero-filled on every path and nothing is stored; the words heard\n        are never returned. Hub absent, slow or unusable: the template (`tier: rules`) and the\n        phone asks the host to type. Increments `tier_ran.voice.{tier}`.\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          audio/wav:\n            schema: { type: string, contentMediaType: audio/wav, maxLength: 400000 }\n      responses:\n        \"200\":\n          description: Draft\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema: { $ref: \"#/components/schemas/DraftResponse\" }\n        \"400\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/BadRequest\" }\n        \"413\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/TooLarge\" }\n        \"415\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/UnsupportedMedia\" }\n        \"429\": { $ref: \"#/components/responses/TooMany\" }\n\n  /api/v1/drafts/ladder:\n    post:''')])\nEOF\nnpm run contracts 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Add 