{"parentUuid":"88cd99f7-b84b-44ce-9bf7-9d13fd956b3f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvydhFYGcmsGvkSSvDky","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Error capture and route spans pass, with nothing personal in the envelopes. Running the full server suite, then committing with an ADR-0021 amendment:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1929,"cache_read_input_tokens":598714,"output_tokens":1393,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":238},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1929,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1393,"cache_read_input_tokens":598714,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1929,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1929},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"614d7f13-2577-4bf4-9884-b0c522210932","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfvydg1rzGYdnCA4gJHHy","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9b898a3d-4edb-40c3-be07-9c5349530b14","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:09:39.283Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"9b898a3d-4edb-40c3-be07-9c5349530b14","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvydhFYGcmsGvkSSvDky","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016Fmqt4qxGWbCjjWYA8955y","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && npx vitest run apps/server/test 2>&1 | grep -E \"Tests |FAIL\" | head -3; npm run typecheck 2>&1 | grep -c \"error TS\"; npm run lint 2>&1 | grep -c \"×\"; cat >> docs/architecture/adr/0021-sentry-agent-tracing.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Amendment (Sun 2026-10-11): route performance and server errors\n- **Route performance.** A sampled share of API requests (`FLARE_HTTP_SAMPLE`, default 0.2) becomes one `http.server` transaction each.\n  - Name: the method and the API area only, for example `PUT:gatherings`.\n  - Attributes: `flare.route` (the same token), `flare.status` (`2xx`, `4xx` or `5xx`) and `flare.ok`.\n  - Never sent: the path, ids, the query, headers or bodies. `routeToken()` builds the name from the first path segment after `/api/v1/`.\n- **Server errors.** An unhandled error (not an `ApiError`) is captured with its class and a fingerprint of class plus route token. `scrubEvent()` still drops the message, request, user, tags, breadcrumbs and frame variables.\n- **The Mastra agent** was already traced (ADR-0025):\n  - the run is `invoke_agent flare-ladder` with `flare.agent`;\n  - each tool is `execute_tool <name>` (sunset, weather_window, nearby_places, step_templates, enforce_ladder, keep_asked);\n  - model calls are `chat <model>` with the provider that answered.\n- **Tests.** `apps/server/test/tracing.test.ts` adds a run with sampling at 1 against a route that throws a TypeError whose message holds a marker phrase and a UUID. The envelope has `GET:health`, `GET:boom`, `TypeError` and `flare.status`, and contains neither the marker, `/api/v1` nor the UUID.\nEOF\ngit add apps/server docs/architecture/adr/0021-sentry-agent-tracing.md && git commit -q -m \"Sentry: route performance and server errors, same allow-list\n\nSampled http.server transactions named by method and API area only\n(PUT:gatherings), with the status class; unhandled errors captured as\ntheir class with a class+route fingerprint, the message dropped. The\nMastra agent run and its tools were already traced. Test: a throwing\nroute with a marker and a UUID in the message: the envelope carries\nGET:health, GET:boom, TypeError and flare.status, and none of the\nmarker, /api/v1 or the UUID. ADR-0021 amended.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"","description":"Server tests; ADR amendment; commit; deploy","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1929,"cache_read_input_tokens":598714,"output_tokens":1393,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":238},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1929,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1393,"cache_read_input_tokens":598714,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1929,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1929},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016Fmqt4qxGWbCjjWYA8955y":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && npx vitest run apps/server/test 2>&1 | grep -E \"Tests |FAIL\" | head -3; npm run typecheck 2>&1 | grep -c \"error TS\"; npm run lint 2>&1 | grep -c \"×\"; cat >> docs/architecture/adr/0021-sentry-agent-tracing.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Amendment (Sun 2026-10-11): route performance and server errors\n- **Route performance.** A sampled share of API requests (`FLARE_HTTP_SAMPLE`, default 0.2) becomes one `http.server` transaction each.\n  - Name: the method and the API area only, for example `PUT:gatherings`.\n  - Attributes: `flare.route` (the same token), `flare.status` (`2xx`, `4xx` or `5xx`) and `flare.ok`.\n  - Never sent: the path, ids, the query, headers or bodies. `routeToken()` builds the name from the first path segment after `/api/v1/`.\n- **Server errors.** An unhandled error (not an `ApiError`) is captured with its class and a fingerprint of class plus route token. `scrubEvent()` still drops the message, request, user, tags, breadcrumbs and frame variables.\n- **The Mastra agent** was already traced (ADR-0025):\n  - the run is `invoke_agent flare-ladder` with `flare.agent`;\n  - each tool is `execute_tool <name>` (sunset, weather_window, nearby_places, step_templates, enforce_ladder, keep_asked);\n  - model calls are `chat <model>` with the provider that answered.\n- **Tests.** `apps/server/test/tracing.test.ts` adds a run with sampling at 1 against a route that throws a TypeError whose message holds a marker phrase and a UUID. The envelope has `GET:health`, `GET:boom`, `TypeError` and `flare.status`, and contains neither the marker, `/api/v1` nor the UUID.\nEOF\ngit add apps/server docs/architecture/adr/0021-sentry-agent-tracing.md && git commit -q -m \"Sentry: route performance and server errors, same allow-list\n\nSampled http.server transactions named by method and API area only\n(PUT:gatherings), with the status class; unhandled errors captured as\ntheir class with a class+route fingerprint, the message dropped. The\nMastra agent run and its tools were already traced. Test: a throwing\nroute with a marker and a UUID in the message: the envelope carries\nGET:health, GET:boom, TypeError and flare.status, and none of the\nmarker, /api/v1 or the UUID. ADR-0021 amended.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"","description":"Server tests; ADR amendment; commit; deploy","timeout":900000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"614d7f13-2577-4bf4-9884-b0c522210932","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfvydg1rzGYdnCA4gJHHy","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dc8295e9-354f-4fea-92b9-9e021a252a3e","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:09:48.030Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
