ing, cut together) | 10 s |\n| 5 | Find them | Friend | Find them, the compass turns, the spoken direction (\"Fuego, 120 meters, to your right\") with sound on | 10 s |\n| 6 | Arriving | Both | Phones down, people meet at the bench. Film this with a second phone's camera, not the screen | 10 s |\n| 7 | A Spark | Friend | I'm here, leave a one-line Spark, Save it | 10 s |\n| 8 | Telegram | Any | The group chat: the Flare card, the count edit after a tap, and the card gone after the end | 10 s |\n\nIf there's time, one extra: an Ember run, where not enough people say yes in time and it shrinks to \"Smaller plan: 15 min at …\".\n\nBefore posting: blur faces of anyone who didn't agree to be shown, and check that no full names, phone numbers or other chats are visible in the frame. Keep the files in docs/post/media/ under 10 MB each (iPhone: Photos, Edit, trim to the shot).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"bea6d285-cbbd-49be-8ba3-66bca6ff0493","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"<project>/flare","root":"<project>/flare","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":11,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":27},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"<project>/flare","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"edbe32ac-c08d-4272-8c8e-9fbaf9586b8a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
