{"parentUuid":"b1c723a8-4056-4943-8c31-a99289673824","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e567af3c-70c1-46ba-b5a8-ec342a0e3f0d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0161s3t6vHyxYH3vZtF8kFoo","type":"tool_result","content":"# Post media\n\nReal screenshots from the real app on the real stack (server, hub with Gemma 4 E4B, engine, PGlite), Chrome at iPhone size (390x844 @2x), JPEG quality 78. Captured Sun 2026-10-11 ~07:45 ET. The Ember shot used the e2e test clock to jump 30 minutes; nothing else is staged. Telegram cards come from the server's own renderer (`apps/server/src/telegram/card.ts`).\n\n| File | Moment |\n| --- | --- |\n| 01-host-words.jpg | The photo developed, six words from the model |\n| 01-host-send.jpg | Send it: how many it needs, what's near |\n| 01-host-sent.jpg | Sent |\n| 02-friend-invite.jpg | The friend's invite |\n| 03-friend-lit.jpg, 03-host-lit.jpg | It's lit, on both phones |\n| 04-friend-compass.jpg | Find them: distance and spoken direction |\n| 05-friend-spark.jpg | Leaving a Spark |\n| 06-friend-ember.jpg, 06-host-ember.jpg | 30 minutes without enough yeses: the smaller plan |\n| 07-telegram-card-kindling.png, 07-telegram-card-lit.png | The Telegram card, Kindling and Lit |\n\nStill to add: [FIELD] photos from the field test, and the iPhone screen recording from [shot-list.md](../shot-list.md).","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f4131fb0-8603-4bc8-b750-ed6b0ff72288","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:37:45.162Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Post media\n\nReal screenshots from the real app on the real stack (server, hub with Gemma 4 E4B, engine, PGlite), Chrome at iPhone size (390x844 @2x), JPEG quality 78. Captured Sun 2026-10-11 ~07:45 ET. The Ember shot used the e2e test clock to jump 30 minutes; nothing else is staged. Telegram cards come from the server's own renderer (`apps/server/src/telegram/card.ts`).\n\n| File | Moment |\n| --- | --- |\n| 01-host-words.jpg | The photo developed, six words from the model |\n| 01-host-send.jpg | Send it: how many it needs, what's near |\n| 01-host-sent.jpg | Sent |\n| 02-friend-invite.jpg | The friend's invite |\n| 03-friend-lit.jpg, 03-host-lit.jpg | It's lit, on both phones |\n| 04-friend-compass.jpg | Find them: distance and spoken direction |\n| 05-friend-spark.jpg | Leaving a Spark |\n| 06-friend-ember.jpg, 06-host-ember.jpg | 30 minutes without enough yeses: the smaller plan |\n| 07-telegram-card-kindling.png, 07-telegram-card-lit.png | The Telegram card, Kindling and Lit |\n\nStill to add: [FIELD] photos from the field test, and the iPhone screen recording from [shot-list.md](../shot-list.md).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8c4741af-fd34-4111-a39a-dcc64cab98ca","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"<project>/flare","root":"<project>/flare","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":11,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":27},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"<project>/flare","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b1c723a8-4056-4943-8c31-a99289673824","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
