{"parentUuid":"7eb37a32-b6be-42e7-96fd-e8ec8fb2face","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw1yvwbHjJrauTpyTTph","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Media is recaptured. Updating the media README, then writing the full post:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_read_input_tokens":651882,"output_tokens":1351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":651882,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce65c99e-bd32-463c-8981-251978525a8d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw1yumtztazDEDRMu47r","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9edce6d7-841c-4edd-ae0d-793e4643e342","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:40:24.462Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"9edce6d7-841c-4edd-ae0d-793e4643e342","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw1yvwbHjJrauTpyTTph","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K9qajuEyZYUFPNQ2Jgyrtb","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<project>/flare/docs/post/media/README.md","content":"# Post media\n\nThese are real screenshots from the real app on the real stack: the server, the hub running Gemma 4 E4B on this Mac, the engine and PGlite. They were taken in Chrome at iPhone size (390x844 @2x), JPEG quality 78, on Sun 2026-10-11 at about 15:45 ET, by `scripts/capture-media.ts`. Re-run it with `npm run build && node scripts/capture-media.ts`.\n\nThe host picks a real photo through the app's own \"Pick a photo\": Eagle Lake, Acadia National Park, public domain (NPS, see [docs/credits/photos.md](../../credits/photos.md)). The fake camera's test pattern isn't used. The Ember shot jumps 31 minutes with the e2e test clock, which only exists with an in-memory database. Nothing else is staged.\n\n| File | Moment | From |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 00-home.jpg | Home: golden hour, the weather, the nearest green spot, Light a Flare | capture-media.ts |\n| 01-host-words.jpg | The photo developed, with the invite Gemma 4 wrote from it (\"Meet by the quiet water's edge\") | capture-media.ts |\n| 01-host-send.jpg | Send it: how many it needs, where you'll be | capture-media.ts |\n| 01-host-sent.jpg | Sent | capture-media.ts |\n| 02-friend-invite.jpg | The friend's invite: photo, words, walk time, the count, I'm in | capture-media.ts |\n| 03-friend-lit.jpg, 03-host-lit.jpg | It's lit, on both phones, with Tell the chat on the host's | capture-media.ts |\n| 04-friend-compass.jpg | Find them: 400 m. A headless browser has no compass, so it asks to hold the phone flat | capture-media.ts |\n| 04b-demo-compass-ahead.jpg | Find them with a heading: \"The bench by the willow is straight ahead\" | e2e demo |\n| 05-friend-spark.jpg | Leaving a Spark, with Say it (Voice Spark) | capture-media.ts |\n| 06-friend-ember.jpg | Needs 3, one yes, 31 minutes later: the smaller plan at West Road | capture-media.ts |\n| 07-telegram-card-kindling.png, 07-telegram-card-lit.png | The Telegram card, Kindling and Lit, from the server's own renderer | earlier capture; the renderer is unchanged |\n| 08-voice-flare-send.png | A Voice Flare: \"Meet at the pond bench\", written by Gemma 4 from what was said, with no photo | e2e voice-flare (real hub) |\n| 09-crew-atlas.png | The Crew Atlas, drawn on the phone from the sealed Hot spots | e2e sparks (real stack) |\n| 10-plan-lit.png | A Plan solved at the deadline: step 3, the biggest step all three can do | e2e plan (real stack) |\n| 11-demo-friend-view.jpg | The demo's friend view | e2e demo |\n| 12-site-home-phone.png, 13-site-feature-cards.png | The website on a phone, and the feature cards on desktop | local build |\n| sim/fairlane-sim-42.gif | \"A Saturday in Fairlane, played by 48 friends\": the simulation (labelled Simulation) | tools/sim |\n\nStill to add: the founder's iPhone screen recording from [shot-list.md](../shot-list.md), and a Sentry trace screenshot from the live project (it needs the founder's Sentry login).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_read_input_tokens":651882,"output_tokens":1351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":651882,"cache_creation_input_tokens":411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":411},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01K9qajuEyZYUFPNQ2Jgyrtb":{"file_path":"<project>/flare/docs/post/media/README.md","content":"# Post media\n\nThese are real screenshots from the real app on the real stack: the server, the hub running Gemma 4 E4B on this Mac, the engine and PGlite. They were taken in Chrome at iPhone size (390x844 @2x), JPEG quality 78, on Sun 2026-10-11 at about 15:45 ET, by `scripts/capture-media.ts`. Re-run it with `npm run build && node scripts/capture-media.ts`.\n\nThe host picks a real photo through the app's own \"Pick a photo\": Eagle Lake, Acadia National Park, public domain (NPS, see [docs/credits/photos.md](../../credits/photos.md)). The fake camera's test pattern isn't used. The Ember shot jumps 31 minutes with the e2e test clock, which only exists with an in-memory database. Nothing else is staged.\n\n| File | Moment | From |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 00-home.jpg | Home: golden hour, the weather, the nearest green spot, Light a Flare | capture-media.ts |\n| 01-host-words.jpg | The photo developed, with the invite Gemma 4 wrote from it (\"Meet by the quiet water's edge\") | capture-media.ts |\n| 01-host-send.jpg | Send it: how many it needs, where you'll be | capture-media.ts |\n| 01-host-sent.jpg | Sent | capture-media.ts |\n| 02-friend-invite.jpg | The friend's invite: photo, words, walk time, the count, I'm in | capture-media.ts |\n| 03-friend-lit.jpg, 03-host-lit.jpg | It's lit, on both phones, with Tell the chat on the host's | capture-media.ts |\n| 04-friend-compass.jpg | Find them: 400 m. A headless browser has no compass, so it asks to hold the phone flat | capture-media.ts |\n| 04b-demo-compass-ahead.jpg | Find them with a heading: \"The bench by the willow is straight ahead\" | e2e demo |\n| 05-friend-spark.jpg | Leaving a Spark, with Say it (Voice Spark) | capture-media.ts |\n| 06-friend-ember.jpg | Needs 3, one yes, 31 minutes later: the smaller plan at West Road | capture-media.ts |\n| 07-telegram-card-kindling.png, 07-telegram-card-lit.png | The Telegram card, Kindling and Lit, from the server's own renderer | earlier capture; the renderer is unchanged |\n| 08-voice-flare-send.png | A Voice Flare: \"Meet at the pond bench\", written by Gemma 4 from what was said, with no photo | e2e voice-flare (real hub) |\n| 09-crew-atlas.png | The Crew Atlas, drawn on the phone from the sealed Hot spots | e2e sparks (real stack) |\n| 10-plan-lit.png | A Plan solved at the deadline: step 3, the biggest step all three can do | e2e plan (real stack) |\n| 11-demo-friend-view.jpg | The demo's friend view | e2e demo |\n| 12-site-home-phone.png, 13-site-feature-cards.png | The website on a phone, and the feature cards on desktop | local build |\n| sim/fairlane-sim-42.gif | \"A Saturday in Fairlane, played by 48 friends\": the simulation (labelled Simulation) | tools/sim |\n\nStill to add: the founder's iPhone screen recording from [shot-list.md](../shot-list.md), and a Sentry trace screenshot from the live project (it needs the founder's Sentry login).\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce65c99e-bd32-463c-8981-251978525a8d","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfw1yumtztazDEDRMu47r","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1e6e6011-0cc0-42f1-a5c5-22d83a5b954c","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:40:34.458Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
