{"parentUuid":"a1f06a77-6521-459f-8662-18251fdcf5c7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e567af3c-70c1-46ba-b5a8-ec342a0e3f0d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G2MoD2S59Nu8QDeKbjKkf8","type":"tool_result","content":"## Measured, seed 42 (one real run, 2026-10-11)\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Friends | 48 in 4 groups |\n| Gatherings | 12 (8 Flares, 4 Plans) |\n| Light rate | 91.7% (11 of 12) |\n| Embers | 2; 1 lit, so Ember save rate 50% |\n| Median time to Lit | 28.5 min overall (Plans light at the 30 min deadline); 14.75 min for Flares |\n| Headcount | 48 in the chosen sets, 40 arrivals counted (\"I'm here\") |\n| Sparks | 26 saved with tickets after Done |\n| Deletion | 12 of 12 gatherings return 404; `GET /api/v1/audit` pass: true, 0 expired rows |\n| Server calls | about 200 writes, 1,000 reads; about 280 s on this laptop |\n\n## CSP hosts needed (app.ts not edited)\n\nTested on the real server serving the build: the only thing blocked on `/sim/` is the map tiles.\n\n- `connect-src https://tile.openstreetmap.org` (MapLibre fetches the tile PNGs; it draws them from\n  `blob:`, which `img-src` already allows)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5417c505-b2b1-4d04-a418-8e443f6e0723","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:41:05.554Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Measured, seed 42 (one real run, 2026-10-11)\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Friends | 48 in 4 groups |\n| Gatherings | 12 (8 Flares, 4 Plans) |\n| Light rate | 91.7% (11 of 12) |\n| Embers | 2; 1 lit, so Ember save rate 50% |\n| Median time to Lit | 28.5 min overall (Plans light at the 30 min deadline); 14.75 min for Flares |\n| Headcount | 48 in the chosen sets, 40 arrivals counted (\"I'm here\") |\n| Sparks | 26 saved with tickets after Done |\n| Deletion | 12 of 12 gatherings return 404; `GET /api/v1/audit` pass: true, 0 expired rows |\n| Server calls | about 200 writes, 1,000 reads; about 280 s on this laptop |\n\n## CSP hosts needed (app.ts not edited)\n\nTested on the real server serving the build: the only thing blocked on `/sim/` is the map tiles.\n\n- `connect-src https://tile.openstreetmap.org` (MapLibre fetches the tile PNGs; it draws them from\n  `blob:`, which `img-src` already allows)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"11cb719f-6dab-4d9c-9213-8aeaea311739","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"<project>/flare","root":"<project>/flare","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":22,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":37},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"<project>/flare","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a1f06a77-6521-459f-8662-18251fdcf5c7","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
