{"parentUuid":"b5dd3ca2-f979-4570-996b-ea07bd3af1a6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw29ZazQvCd6NhqK1JYb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013xGNejiPKVvoXvt4YRiVy6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/post/draft.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold='''| Text | Plan \"ladders\": a big plan and three smaller versions | 13 asks, p95 5.1 s; Fix the map tags, 0 off the allow-list |'''\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,'''| Text | Plan \"ladders\": a big plan and three smaller versions | 13/13 valid, p95 5.5 s; Fix the map tags, 0 off the allow-list |''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add docs/post scripts/capture-media.ts scripts/fixtures/media-eagle-lake.jpg 2>/dev/null; git status --short docs/post scripts | head; git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nPost: full draft with every signature moment and its proof; new media\n\n- docs/post/draft.md rewritten in the template's order: what it does\n  and for whom; the demo and live links; how it was tested (no\n  outdoor group test is claimed: real-stack e2e, two iPhones, the\n  48-friend simulation, 4 fresh-eyes rounds, axe 0); Gemma 4 with\n  three senses (vision, audio, text) and the model table; the Google\n  cloud tier and its thinking finding; DigitalOcean [PENDING DO\n  BILLING]; Mastra, Tinker, ElevenLabs and Sentry, each with numbers;\n  what went wrong; what wasn't built and why; open innovation.\n  [FIELD] marks only what the founder must add.\n- docs/post/media recaptured from the current UI on the real stack by\n  scripts/capture-media.ts (a public-domain NPS photo picked through\n  the app, Gemma 4 writing the invite), plus Voice Flare, Crew Atlas,\n  Plan, demo and website shots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Fix ladder line; commit post and media","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_r