css, components (Flame, Button, Icon, PhotoPrint, TypeWords, NeedCount, AccessLine, NatureLine, Sheet, TextField, QuorumToggle, Banner, Compass, StepLadder, ListRow, TopBar, Screen), screens registry + one component per screen id, routes (/screens, /screens/[id], /proto, /components, /site), scripts/export.mjs (playwright-core + Chrome: hi-fi PNGs per screen/state/theme, wireframes via data-wire), scripts/a11y.mjs (axe-core), docs/design/03..07, handoff 04 (motion and copy).\n\n## Progress (product design)\n- Components done: Flame, Button, Icon, PhotoPrint, TypeWords, NeedCount, InfoLines, Screen (with overlay slot), Sheet (Bits Dialog + inline), TextField, Choice (Bits ToggleGroup), Compass, Ladder, SampleScene. sample.ts holds shared copy and data.\n- Screens done: H1 to H6 (src/lib/screens), registry.ts, /screens/[id] route, /screens/manifest.json, scripts/export.mjs (44 PNGs + 6 wireframes, 0 page errors), scripts/contact.mjs, scripts/shot.mjs.\n- Gotchas: screen prop is `view`, not `state` (clashes with $state rune); imports use #lib/...ts with extension (BUG-008).\n\n## Progress update (latest)\n- Hearth (flame + ground + sparks + horizon) and Scenery (golden-hour scene) components done; used on H4, H5, H6, I4, I6, I8, I9, I10, I12.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"21659840-8920-4f70-834e-7472e2862bcc","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"<project>/flare","root":"<project>/flare","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":11,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":27},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"<project>/flare","plat