{"parentUuid":"c2ff5263-7576-4024-b240-378aa0aa99db","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw2FtPVaDiMseBDTnVus","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UsEJ1nBgSX3azcz5SERwXS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/handoffs/RESUME.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ntop='''# Resume note\n\n## Now: Sun 2026-10-11, ~16:10 ET (read this first)\n- **Live:** https://flare-outside.onrender.com (Render free tier, auto-deploy off; `npm run deploy:render -- --yes`). The hub runs on this Mac against live (`FLARE_SERVER_URL=wss://flare-outside.onrender.com npm run hub`); restart it after hub code changes.\n- **Done today:**\n  - Gemini cloud tier (ADR-0026)\n  - ElevenLabs warm voice and Voice Spark (ADR-0027)\n  - Voice Flares (ADR-0028)\n  - Crew Atlas (ADR-0029)\n  - automations (ADR-0030)\n  - Sentry route performance and errors (ADR-0021 amended)\n  - website feature cards and Built with\n  - fresh-eyes rounds 1 to 3, all fixed\n  - page audit (axe 0 on 88 views, Lighthouse 100)\n  - Plan and Voice e2e\n  - media recapture (`scripts/capture-media.ts`)\n  - the post draft (`docs/post/draft.md`)\n- **Open for the founder:**\n  - fill the [FIELD]s in the post: quote, video, image uploads, Entire links, Sentry screenshot;\n  - make the repo public;\n  - fix DigitalOcean billing ([PENDING DO BILLING]);\n  - decide on Google billing (paid terms stop prompts being used to improve Google products);\n  - delete the stale untracked folders `apps/web/static/scenic/` and `scenery/*-640|1280*`.\n- **Queued:** zod → zod/mini (about 16 KB of JS headroom); the remaining fresh-eyes items (docs/research/fresh-eyes-2026-10-11.md); round 4 results.\n- **Backlog with status:** docs/engineering/07-sunday-backlog.md.\n\n## Older notes\n'''\ns=s.replace('# Resume note\\n',top,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add docs/handoffs/RESUME.md docs/engineering/07-sunday-backlog.md && git commit -q -m \"RESUME and backlog: Sunday status for the founder's review\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Update RESUME; commit backlog and resume","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2675,"cache_read_input_tokens":671057,"output_tokens":1051,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":34},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2675,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1051,"cache_read_input_tokens":671057,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2675,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2675},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01UsEJ1nBgSX3azcz5SERwXS":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/handoffs/RESUME.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ntop='''# Resume note\n\n## Now: Sun 2026-10-11, ~16:10 ET (read this first)\n- **Live:** https://flare-outside.onrender.com (Render free tier, auto-deploy off; `npm run deploy:render -- --yes`). The hub runs on this Mac against live (`FLARE_SERVER_URL=wss://flare-outside.onrender.com npm run hub`); restart it after hub code changes.\n- **Done today:**\n  - Gemini cloud tier (ADR-0026)\n  - ElevenLabs warm voice and Voice Spark (ADR-0027)\n  - Voice Flares (ADR-0028)\n  - Crew Atlas (ADR-0029)\n  - automations (ADR-0030)\n  - Sentry route performance and errors (ADR-0021 amended)\n  - website feature cards and Built with\n  - fresh-eyes rounds 1 to 3, all fixed\n  - page audit (axe 0 on 88 views, Lighthouse 100)\n  - Plan and Voice e2e\n  - media recapture (`scripts/capture-media.ts`)\n  - the post draft (`docs/post/draft.md`)\n- **Open for the founder:**\n  - fill the [FIELD]s in the post: quote, video, image uploads, Entire links, Sentry screenshot;\n  - make the repo public;\n  - fix DigitalOcean billing ([PENDING DO BILLING]);\n  - decide on Google billing (paid terms stop prompts being used to improve Google products);\n  - delete the stale untracked folders `apps/web/static/scenic/` and `scenery/*-640|1280*`.\n- **Queued:** zod → zod/mini (about 16 KB of JS headroom); the remaining fresh-eyes items (docs/research/fresh-eyes-2026-10-11.md); round 4 results.\n- **Backlog with status:** docs/engineering/07-sunday-backlog.md.\n\n## Older notes\n'''\ns=s.replace('# Resume note\\n',top,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngit add docs/handoffs/RESUME.md docs/engineering/07-sunday-backlog.md && git commit -q -m \"RESUME and backlog: Sunday status for the founder's review\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Update RESUME; commit backlog and resume","timeout":600000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"99761847-bb6e-404d-9a8b-0cb0d4fa491c","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfw2FsB5PSamnrqWwK1Jq","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b991ad85-a9bd-4fc5-a9df-93c8752e0ad3","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:44:09.012Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
