{"parentUuid":"ac279e77-0b9f-45f2-a6f8-6d55ace06344","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>11425372 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"391197b1-fe8e-49c3-a269-660238b1d37b","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:45:12.484Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>11425372 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"391197b1-fe8e-49c3-a269-660238b1d37b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw2ML9SLRT1iFXeaSbbr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019qJqe1U3EJuRL6KzPYMLAF","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"uds:<socket>","summary":"Automations, Sentry, audit, media, post done","message":"Milestone: automations, Sentry depth, the page audit, the media and the full post draft are done and pushed. Live is 1d318fb (smoke passes). Fresh-eyes round 4 is still running on live.\n\n**Automations (ADR-0030)**\n- New: a Plan reminder 30 min before start. It's a new engine job (`plan_reminder`) that pushes `plan_soon` to the set. The push text is built on the phone from the sealed notice, and migration 0005 adds the job kind.\n- New: a weather-aware Ember. When rain is likely, covered seats (covered/shelter tags, or within 25 m of a shelter) go first and read \"…, under cover\". This runs on the phone.\n- New: \"Tell the chat\" on the host's Lit screen.\n- Already existed: auto-solve at the deadline, still-coming, and offline save.\n- Not built, with reasons in the ADR:\n  - golden-hour push: the server never knows a crew's location;\n  - weekly recap push: there's no crew time zone.\n  - Home and Crew already show both.\n\n**Sentry**\n- Mastra agent runs and tools were already traced.\n- Added sampled route performance, named by method and area only (e.g. `PUT:gatherings`), never a path.\n- Added unhandled-error capture: class plus route fingerprint, message dropped.\n- A test throws with a marker phrase and a UUID in the message, then proves neither reaches the envelope. ADR-0021 amended.\n- A trace screenshot needs the founder's Sentry login.\n\n**Page audit**\n- axe across 22 pages × 2 widths × 2 schemes went from 16 findings to 0.\n- Fixes: focusable scroll regions, landmarks for the stage photo, hero and demo notes, and 44 px targets (Built with links, nav, /sim/ controls).\n- Lighthouse is 100 on all 5 pages. /how/'s first screen preloads.\n- Every flow ends pointing outside.\n\n**Media**\n- scripts/capture-media.ts recaptures every shot from the current UI on the real stack: server, hub with Gemma, engine. A public-domain NPS photo is picked through the app, and Gemma writes \"Meet by the quiet water's edge\".\n- Added Voice Flare, Crew Atlas, Plan, demo friend view and website shots.\n- docs/post/media/README.md lists each file and its source.\n\n**Post (docs/post/draft.md, about 2,900 words, template order)**\n- No outdoor group-test claim. \"How I tested it\" covers real-stack e2e (10 suites), two iPhones, the 48-friend sim, 4 fresh-eyes rounds and axe 0.\n- Signature moments, each with proof:\n  - Gemma: three senses, vision/audio/text, Voice Flare 3.3 s, the model table and guards.\n  - Google cloud tier: the thinking finding, 21.7 s → 1.4 s.\n  - DigitalOcean: [PENDING DO BILLING].\n  - Mastra: p95 5.1 vs 5.5 s, weather 7/7.\n  - Tinker: 15/40 → LoRA 38/40 for $2.40, rules 20 → 30/40 blind.\n  - ElevenLabs: 698 chars, offline, Voice Spark 0.72 s.\n  - Sentry: allow-list proven by a test.\n  - Privacy, including the Atlas.\n- \"What I got wrong\" has 9 concrete bugs, including the site-CSS leak and the silent Plan send.\n- [FIELD] marks only founder items: the quote, video, image uploads, Entire links, the Sentry screenshot, and making the repo public.\n- It may need trimming; that's the founder's call at review.\n\n**Tests:** all pass. Unit 769 (681/62/26); e2e: plan, voice, sparks, demo, loop, telegram, field 27/27, pwa; kit a11y 0. JS: /app 146 KB, /g/ 145 KB.\n\nRESUME.md and the backlog are current. I'll fix round 4's findings when it reports.","type":"message","recipient":"uds:<socket>","recipient_kind":"session","content":"Milestone: automations, Sentry depth, the page au…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1