{"parentUuid":"4c948eec-43e0-4bcf-9599-cdb1cd34845c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>11423833 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"95a20f73-37bd-4f8f-aa97-61fe200c6f20","timestamp":"2026-10-11T19:45:28.704Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>11423833 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"95a20f73-37bd-4f8f-aa97-61fe200c6f20","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw2NXMQCLHEtLtsSAZvW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Automations, Sentry depth, the page audit, the post media and a full post draft are done and live, about four hours before the 8 PM target. Fresh-eyes round 4 is still running against the live site; I'll fix whatever it finds.\n\n**What's new on the live site:**\n- **Automations:**\n  - A reminder goes out 30 minutes before a Plan starts.\n  - When rain is likely, the shrunk plan prefers covered benches and says \"under cover\".\n  - The host's Lit screen has a \"Tell the chat\" share button.\n- **Not built, on purpose:** a golden-hour push and a weekly recap push. The server never knows where a crew is or what time zone it's in. Home already shows golden hour, and the Crew page shows the week.\n- **Sentry:** it now tracks route speed and server errors without sending a URL, id or error message. A test proves that.\n- **Voice Flares:** Gemma 4 on your laptop writes the invite from what you say. Live it took 3.6 s.\n- **Crew Atlas:** a map of your crew's places, drawn on the phone with no requests.\n- **Feature cards:** the website has them, plus a \"Built with\" strip.\n\n**Page audit:** accessibility checks went from 16 issues to 0 across 22 pages, two screen widths and light and dark. Every tap target is at least 44 px, and Lighthouse is 100 on all five site pages.\n\n**Post (`docs/post/draft.md`):**\n- It follows the challenge template and doesn't claim an outdoor group test.\n- Each tool has its proof:\n  - Gemma: photo, voice and text in one model, compared against four others.\n  - Google cloud fallback: 21.7 s down to 1.4 s.\n  - Mastra and Tinker: their eval numbers.\n  - ElevenLabs: a compass voice that sends nothing, and Voice Spark.\n  - Sentry: data rules backed by a test.\n- It has nine concrete \"what I got wrong\" bugs.\n- DigitalOcean is marked [PENDING DO BILLING]. I left out the Render category: it requires the model to run on Render, and ours doesn't.\n- It runs about 2,900 words, so you may want to trim it at review.\n\nThe screenshots were recaptured from the current app with a public-domain park photo, and `docs/post/media/README.md` lists each one's source.\n\n**Checks:** all 769 unit tests and every end-to-end suite pass.\n\n**Before publishing, you need to:**\n- Fill the [FIELD] spots: a one-line quote in your words, the video, image uploads, Entire session links and a Sentry trace screenshot (it needs your Sentry login).\n- Make the repo public. The post embeds it and the site links to it.\n- Fix DigitalOcean billing, or leave it marked pending.\n- Decide on Google billing. On the free tier Google may use what it receives and people there may review it; paid terms stop that.\n- Delete the two stale untracked image folders I was told to leave alone (`apps/web/static/scenic/`, and the `-640`/`-1280` files in `scenery/`).\n\n`docs/handoffs/RESUME.md` and the backlog are current."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1656,"cache_read_input_tokens":674837,"output_tokens":1046,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1656,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1046,"cache_read_input_tokens":674837,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1656,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1656},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"efaf797b-da66-40fd-b394-351a69e768b8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw2NWCD7hCU4qePqDYy3","requestedModel":"cl